# Build context slimming for the Go service images (docker/Dockerfile*, context = repo root).
# Without this the CI context was ~1.96 GB (node_modules + caches) → minutes of transfer + COPY.
# The Go builds need only Go source, go.work*, every module's go.mod/go.sum, and the buf-
# generated gen/ dirs — never node_modules or the JS/Next build artifacts.

# VCS / CI
.git
.github

# JS deps + build/tooling caches (Go builds never touch these; the ui image runs its
# own pnpm install in a build stage and copies node_modules from there, not from context)
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
.nx
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/coverage
**/test-output
**/tmp

# Editor / OS / secrets
.idea
.vscode
**/*.log
.DS_Store
.env
.env.*

# Large runtime data + stale lock not used by the builds
location.json
package-lock.json

# DO NOT exclude (required by go build): gen/  go.work  go.work.sum  **/go.mod  **/go.sum  app/**  pkg/**
